            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Palantir & tech lead gains, Papa John's reported deal to go private",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> kicks off <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute</a> with three of the top stories on Wall Street.</p>\n<p>Tech stocks, like Microsoft (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MSFT\">MSFT</a>), Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>), and Palantir (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PLTR\">PLTR</a>), lead market gains.</p>\n<p>Barrick Mining's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/B\">B</a>) third quarter profits came in line with estimates.</p>\n<p>Papa John's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PZZA\">PZZA</a>) is <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/private-equity-appetite-grows-triartisan-140243776.html\">reportedly</a> near a deal to go private.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
